hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-9 = unlines (cons "The argument of this account is that the five promises of a knowledge graph (identity, justification, composition, inference and currency) aren't five features. They are five aspects of one object, a construction (code with a type together with the rationale that establishes it, kept in a store addressed by content), and a" (cons "graph whose elements are that object keeps all five by construction." nil))
